Source: openclaw
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ackerman-00 <noreply@example.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), binutils, tar, desktop-file-utils
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw

Package: openclaw
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, libayatana-appindicator3-1, libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0, libgtk-3-0
Recommends: xdg-desktop-portal, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Description: Your AI assistant, running on your own devices and chats
 OpenClaw is an open-source personal AI assistant that runs on your own
 computer and answers in the chats you already use. This package ships the
 upstream prebuilt Linux companion app (a GTK3/WebKitGTK window plus the
 bundled Bun runtime) repackaged from the upstream .deb payload as-is.
